OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry and bright at first, but
OL,6,Fbecoming increasingly cloudy and
OL,7,Fbreezy through the morning. Outbreaks
OL,8,Fof rain will soon develop,
OL,9,Foccasionally heavy, though generally
OL,10,Flight for many, before clearing
OL,11,Feastwards by late afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA dry and mostly clear night
OL,14,Fwith winds gradually easing. It will
OL,15,Fturn chilly, with mist and grass frost
OL,16,Flikely in rural areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
