OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F166A1790480869
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FAny mist will soon clear to
OL,6,Fleave a fine day with light winds and
OL,7,Flong sunny periods, perhaps hazy at
OL,8,Ftimes. Feeling pleasantly warm in the
OL,9,Fafternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FBreezy
OL,12,Fand rather cloudy on Tuesday. Heavy
OL,13,Frain followed by blustery showers on
OL,14,FWednesday. Sunny spells with the odd
OL,15,Fshower on Thursday. Above average
OL,16,Fdaytime temperatures though cooler by
OL,17,FThursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
